  "system": {
    "identifier": "voice-change",
    "description": "<p>You coat your tongue in chakra, manipulating the vibrations it provides while speaking. You imitate the voice of any creature you’ve heard before with amazing accuracy. Creatures would need to actively take the See through lies, skill action to tell your voice is fabricated. This effect lasts until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>If cast while you are benefiting from the Transform Genjutsu, this jutsu’s effects last for the duration for the remainder of the Transform jutsu.</p>",
